  "title": "Custom app icons for iOS, Mac, and Android",
  "summary": "<p>Someone on the forum posted <a href=\"https://forum.newsblur.com/t/a-long-ish-list-of-ideas-and-bugs/13674/11\">a long-ish list of ideas</a>, and one of them was small enough that I built it the same week: let people change the NewsBlur app icon. Your home screen is yours, and an app you open dozens of times a day should look the way you want it to. So premium subscribers can now choose a custom app icon on iOS, Mac, and Android.</p> There are 12 color flavors: Sunrise Gold, Ember Orange, Co...",
